WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.750
Imagine a reaction with
a 100 percent yield.

2
00:00:03.800 --> 00:00:08.150
Every gram of product the equation
allows is made and collected.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.370
Nothing is lost along the way.

4
00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:13.450
Could most of the reactants
still end up as waste?

5
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.170
Can a reaction with a 100 percent yield
still turn most of its reactants into waste?

6
00:00:19.220 --> 00:00:21.570
In this mission, you'll meet atom economy,

7
00:00:21.620 --> 00:00:24.530
and calculate it from a balanced equation.

8
00:00:24.580 --> 00:00:27.870
You'll work it out for the
decomposition of limestone into lime.

9
00:00:27.920 --> 00:00:33.490
Your mission: decide whether a perfect
yield can still mean a lot of waste.
